    "text": "……愛依、準備の方は──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040010,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "おかえりなさいませ、ご主人様！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040010"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040020,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "見てみてプロデューサー！\r\nすっごいフリフリ！　ちょー可愛くない！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040190020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "009",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、よく似合ってるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040030,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "マジ？　ありがとー！\r\nなんか、本物のメイドさんになった気分だわ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな。これから撮影だし、\r\n心からなりきるのは大事なことだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040040,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "そうそう！\r\nあ、それなら～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040050,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "プロデューサー、今からうちの『ご主人様』ねっ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺が……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040060,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うん！\r\nうちは、プロデューサーのメイドさん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040070,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ご飯作ってあげたり～、お掃除してあげたり～\r\nプロデューサーのお手伝いするってワケ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……\r\n……でも愛依、今日の企画書は見たよな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040080,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "え？　あー……\r\nうん、ちゃんと見てるけど……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040090,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……『武装メイド』って、何？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040100,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "なんでメイドさんが戦うの！？\r\n銃とかうち、初めて持ったんだけど！　ってなったし！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "しかも『ダーク』だしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040110,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "そう！　うちの思ってたメイドさんと全然違った～\r\nダーク！？　なんでダークなの！？　みたいな！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040120,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "よくわかんなくて調べてみたら、\r\nなんかちょーかっこいいのいっぱい出てきたし！",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040130,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ご主人様を守って戦ったり、\r\n銃思いっきり撃ったりドンパチして……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040140,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "いやー、アイドルもメイドも、\r\n奥が深いわ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんか違うような気もするけど……\r\n……まあ、奥が深いのは確かだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040150,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040160,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "──でもうち、そっちのがいいかも",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040170,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "大事な人のこと、\r\nこっそり支えるってのもいいんだけど～……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "005",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040180,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うちはそれだけじゃなくて、\r\n大事な人を守れるようになりたいって",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040190,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "何かあった時、\r\nなんもできないとか、やじゃん",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "愛依……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040200,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……まあ、\r\nうちは銃撃ったりとか出来ないんだけどさ～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……\r\n……でも、愛依の気持ちもわかるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040210,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "へ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、陰から支えることも大事だ\r\n──でも、それだけじゃなくて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大事な人に何かあった時は……\r\n俺だって、守れるようになりたいからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040220,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "…………アハハッ\r\nプロデューサーちょー謙虚～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040230,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "『なりたい』、とか言ってさぁ──\r\nプロデューサー、もうなれてるじゃん",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040240,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "大事な人を守れる人\r\n困った時、助けてくれる……かっこいい人に、さ",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040250,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うちだって、プロデューサーに\r\nいーっぱい、守ってもらってるんだから",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "愛依……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mei"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040260,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……だから、うちも……\r\n守られるだけじゃ、やだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040270,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うちだって、うちにできる戦い方で、戦う",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040280,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "我慢なんて、聞き分けなんて、知らないし\r\nうち、そんな頭良くないから",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040290,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "守りたいものを守れるように……\r\n──絶対、後悔しないように",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………そうか\r\nうん、愛依らしいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040300,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "アハハ、でしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040310,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "──そんなわけで、\r\nうちにできる精いっぱい、やってこよっかな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040320,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "仕方なくこのキャラやってるとか誰も思わないような、\r\nかっこよくて、ミステリアスで……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040330,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "サイコーにクールで、魅力的なアイドル……\r\n──プロデューサーが、教えてくれた道……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040340,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うちにくれた、武器でさ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだな。じゃあ改めて……\r\n──愛依、準備の方はどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040350,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……バッチリだし、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040350"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040360,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うちの戦い方、見せてくるから\r\nちゃんと見ててよ──",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900604/2019006040360"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019006040370,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ね、ご主人様？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
